        <Desc>CDRI HOSTS ANNUAL OR SEMI-ANNUAL CAMPS THAT EXTEND EDUCATIONAL EXPERIENCES TO COLLEGE STUDENTS BEYOND THE FIVE NEIGHBORHOODS WHERE IT CURRENTLY OPERATES. THE PROGRAM DEVELOPS A POOL OF FUTURE COLLABORATORS FOR CDRI'S CURRENT AND EXPANDING NEIGHBORHOOD INITIATIVES.</Desc>
